{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c216a4e40aeb9ac52336be50fed581fe6f379a0bda32fcb8aa2f53d5893fb761", "ja": "（今日は、まつりの宣材写真を撮りに来た。\n今のところ、緊張はしてないみたいだけど……）", "zh": "（今天要来拍茉莉的宣传照。\n目前看来，她似乎并不紧张……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c5421e5cb43803c89416168276f9d2fc1cdb4e591017c628cc45eef7b603c60f", "ja": "まつり。\nもうすぐ撮影が始まるけど、緊張してないか？", "zh": "茉莉。\n快要开始拍摄了，你不会紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "eeaf839bc6f9b9ffb74eb14853d53624f4007f92bbcce32db382c004b8e6950a", "ja": "はいほー！\n心配せず、姫におまかせなのです！", "zh": "Hi Ho！\n不用担心，包在公主身上的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "abcedefb7db15e2ae0a3f442706315bfe0a010a61f900cff81c7e3b7ff3f3825", "ja": "今日しかない、今日だけのまつりを、\nカメラマンさんに、たくさん撮ってもらいましょー！", "zh": "就请摄影师多拍一些只有今天才能看到，\n今日限定的茉莉吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8faeaaf2355e321765a2fac3cfead7afe38c4de54ef9d82a71dd5050629b7f62", "ja": "うん。その様子なら大丈夫そうだな。", "zh": "嗯，看你这样应该没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "202070c6c708118a2617ccc42ff9ba3f3fa12efbb247b2a93725d91955d53b3a", "ja": "では、プロデューサーさん。\n姫は行ってくるのです！", "zh": "那么，制作人先生。\n公主要过去了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "07102079f62ff2791d7100282ca6215fa2bf8d739ad46d0e6c9f09d41dfb548e", "ja": "（まつりの個性的なテンションに、カメラマンさんが\n戸惑うかもしれない。フォローしなくちゃな）", "zh": "（茉莉充满个性的步调，搞不好会让摄影师\n不知所措，我得从旁协助才行。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "c89700a2f1bf27458c84553e8933ec6727c4c574f6b04a58aa1e0356ec6c76b3", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまなのです！\nまつりの、びゅーりほー！な写真、見てくれましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦你了喔！\n你有看到茉莉那美丽的照片吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f0ac36ba8fb24bf07cfd3032cc39c7e82ba847e9ddab8d7d4914517e1cec5a02", "ja": "お疲れさま、まつり。ああ、見たよ！\nカメラマンさんも、完璧だって褒めてくれてたな。", "zh": "辛苦你了，茉莉。嗯，我有看到喔！\n摄影师也称赞你很完美呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "8766b57e170feb4f1b3284b1fe85905c988c5eb451bdf78f426ce5c29c6e6403", "ja": "ほ？　姫は姫なのですから、\n完璧なのは当たり前なのですよ？", "zh": "哦？毕竟公主可是公主，\n表现完美也是理所当然的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ed61c21ade51d3cdcb1bfc3ffd8d339385a54fe0bacee578e1afc70821314454", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nまつりは自分の魅力をよくわかってるんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n茉莉你很清楚自己的魅力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "13511b2f4effceaca0ae5941709dcd07c9c2b93e96a3753c7e9097bedbf75699", "ja": "はいなのです！　どこから撮ってもかわいい姫は、\nこっちから撮ると、さらにかわいいのです。", "zh": "没错的喔！不管从哪里拍都很可爱的公主，\n从这个角度拍，会更可爱的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1012_p", "source_sha256": "7805ca7d22a80b3e364f3331d3501b88fc2bd4dc1b1c81c518cc8e566aafe5fc", "ja": "どれどれ……おっ、本当だ！\nさすがだな、まつり。", "zh": "我看看……哦，真的耶！\n真不愧是茉莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "13c8e71a57f5a41bb5cd98a602c1a13ee51ef42d504bbfe2a4911200a18ea276", "ja": "これなら宣材写真としてばっちりだ。\nそれじゃあ、そろそろ事務所に戻って……。", "zh": "这些成果作为宣传照非常完美。\n那差不多该回事务所了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "460947e596ee1031977f0acf8dd648e91bf471c275b787f60bbfe7274b5516f5", "ja": "{$P$}さん、待ってほしいのです。\nあとひとつ、試してみたいポーズがあるのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，等一下。\n茉莉还有一个拍照姿势想试试看的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "983beb11493f357aa24850d2a9ee1434056e4127093e08cca7e3a0c5e42b8f30", "ja": "それには、{$P$}さんの協力が\n必要なのです！", "zh": "这个姿势呢，\n需要{$P$}先生帮忙的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "fc89080629ddb16920e53065135b446f47686d035a9c3f50ba64d4e0a1dfc630", "ja": "俺の協力が必要なポーズって……\nまつり、どんなポーズなんだ？", "zh": "需要我帮忙的姿势……\n茉莉，到底是什么姿势啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "5af4b5ebec1062bb4e35f7310532fc1ce8456b4bdcc2d85c0b3aa64bb247896d", "ja": "もちろん、お姫様と言えば定番中の定番……\nお姫様だっこのポーズなのですー！", "zh": "当然，说到公主就不能漏掉经典中的经典……\n公主抱的唷──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ed93709fc3bab4afce8fd44293318ae752ef268ed7764dee9a5933ab3a4743cb", "ja": "えっ！？\nお、お姫様だっこ！？", "zh": "咦！？\n公、公主抱！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "7860125895a9887a4f66df0f5e71ee26c297cdfe2215bdc3ea8f93e77fdb5b27", "ja": "はいなのです！　{$P$}さん、さあ！\nまつりを、お姫様だっこするのです！", "zh": "没错的喔！{$P$}先生，来吧！\n快用公主抱把茉莉抱起来的唷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6f4387d2d8b6e42e7b21f3ab9269c58b061e998caaab11f6a3dc8ed1833e1560", "ja": "いやでもほら、まつりの宣材写真に、\n俺が映るわけにはいかないし。な？", "zh": "不，你想想，这是茉莉的宣传照，\n我不能入镜的，明白吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "d397f9287f56d7a35675c64b4b23c778058d4564c346d77ed4efc351f0cefff7", "ja": "そうなのですか？　残念なのです。\nそれじゃあ、いつか別の機会に……ね？", "zh": "是这样吗？好可惜的呀。\n那就等下次有机会时再试了……呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2da3954e5bf67ab03c39c6c011de476ed0a536756129af887bad9263fedf9af5", "ja": "あ、ああ。考えておくよ！", "zh": "呃，嗯。我会考虑的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_021mat_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_021mat_002_1023_p", "source_sha256": "ab745ae4066510c055b2e6b242852de75b7298596d325334ea4a81ae4db33eb0", "ja": "（安心したと思った瞬間、これか……。\n油断できないな！）", "zh": "（才刚松口气，她又马上说出这种话……\n真是不能掉以轻心！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
